@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557

title RB-D16 — Scoped usable recovery assessment
start
if (RB-D16-C01\nSource/drill scope established = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D16-C02\nConsistency/access checks pass = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D16-C03\nMeasured criteria satisfied = T?) then (yes)
:RB-D16-R07\nSCOPED RECOVERY DEMONSTRATED;
stop
else (no)
if (RB-D16-C03 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D16-R05\nTARGETS NOT MET;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D16-R06\nUNPROVEN TARGET RESULT;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D16-C02 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D16-R03\nINCOMPLETE RECOVERY;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D16-R04\nUNCONFIRMED RECOVERY CHECKS;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D16-C01 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D16-R01\nBLOCK MISSING PREREQUISITES;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D16-R02\nUNPROVEN RECOVERY SOURCE;
stop
endif
endif
legend bottom
Decision alternatives, not execution steps or evaluation timing.
T = established true; F = established false; U = unresolved.
Conditions and full results are defined in the rule table.
All rows here are proposed analysis refinements; no new policy acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
